# SHA256 of the prebuilt OSMesa + LLVM release assets of https://github.com/devernay/osmesa-install
# that release.yml may download (.github/tools/fetch-osmesa.sh), in sha256sum format:
#   <sha256>  osmesa-install-<TAG>-<PLATFORM>.tar.xz
# PLATFORM: macos-arm64 and macos-x86_64 (preferred; or macos-universal), windows-ucrt64-x86_64.
# An asset that is not listed here is never used. Add the lines of a new osmesa-install
# release here (from its own checksums, checked) before setting its tag in release.yml's
# osmesa_release input or the OSMESA_INSTALL_RELEASE repository variable.
# (no osmesa-install binary release yet)
